105
00:07:54,258 --> 00:07:54,921
Three steps.

106
00:07:55,353 --> 00:07:59,185
Step one: keep Agent
Core's OpenTelemetry on.

107
00:08:00,022 --> 00:08:07,073
Agent Core instruments your agent through
ADOT, the AWS distro for OpenTelemetry.

108
00:08:07,919 --> 00:08:11,504
By default, it's what we're going to use.

109
00:08:12,499 --> 00:08:13,386
And don't fight it.

110
00:08:14,243 --> 00:08:18,289
I left it running and added
Datadog exporter next to it in

111
00:08:18,290 --> 00:08:20,574
