112
00:08:21,814 --> 00:08:26,742
Step two, send OTLP straight to Datadog.

113
00:08:27,344 --> 00:08:32,878
The exporter posts spans
to otlp.datadoghq.com

114
00:08:33,878 --> 00:08:41,892
as the endpoint with a header
that says DD-OTLP-source=llmobs.

115
00:08:42,892 --> 00:08:44,112
No collector to run.

116
00:08:45,377 --> 00:08:48,534
And step three, opt
into LLM observability.

117
00:08:48,874 --> 00:08:58,221
Tag your spans with DD_LLMOBS_Enable,
and then make it equal to and

118
00:08:58,236 --> 00:09:00,824
emit GenAI semantic conventions.

119
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:05,048
So this require version one
point three seven or later.

120
00:09:06,019 --> 00:09:09,751
That's what the first
line in the code box does.

