classic monitoring cannot see.

426
00:31:42,973 --> 00:31:49,780
Loops, bad tool calls, and cost spikes all
happen while your dashboards stay green.

427
00:31:50,810 --> 00:31:55,820
Second, AgentCore emits telemetry
and Datadog correlate it with

428
00:31:55,867 --> 00:31:57,962
APM logs and infrastructure.

429
00:31:58,616 --> 00:32:03,154
Remember these three steps:
keep ADOT on, export in code,

430
00:32:03,428 --> 00:32:09,217
and open with DD_LLMOBS_Enable.

431
00:32:10,879 --> 00:32:15,835
And third point, LLM observability
turns each request into readable

432
00:32:15,894 --> 00:32:18,886
trace of decisions, tools and tokens.

433
00:32:20,025 --> 00:32:25,458
